8078b063eefe3c9c64cea3223881ccf8.600x338.jpg?t=1772091217"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425130/ss_2f843f309c9ae9b0bf40a7ed82d1dad3c72a0d0d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772091217","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425130/ss_2f843f309c9ae9b0bf40a7ed82d1dad3c72a0d0d.600x338.jpg?t=1772091217"}],"short_description":"You are blackmailed in Hacked: The Streamer. Investigate clues, make impactful decisions, and shape your story to uncover the culprit is in this thrilling interactive movie. The fate of PinkyPie, a fan-favorite streamer, is\u00a0in\u00a0your\u00a0hands.","steam_appid":2425130,"support_info":{"email":"info@savebutonu.com","url":"https://buttoninteractive.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Russian, Turkish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Traditional Chinese, Indonesian, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://buttoninteractive.com"}